\par\par \b \uc2 Dollar bobs above lows in early European trade.  \b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Dezember 2004\par 09:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 LONDON, Dec 6 (Reuters) - The dollar bobbed above last week's record low against the euro and five-year low against the yen on Monday as dealers weighed up the likelihood of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the greenback.  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's top government spokesman Hiroyuki Hosada said the dollar's current rate against the yen did not reflect fundamentals and Japan would watch \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves before deciding action.  \par \par \uc2 His comments came after Kaoru Yosano, a top policymaker in \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ruling party, told Reuters that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was an option but was only effective in countering short-term, speculative moves.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The dollar stood at 102.30 yen  at 0808 GMT, having fallen on Friday to\par around 101.83 yen, its lowest since January 2000. The greenback fetched\par $1.3420 against the euro       , having fallen to around $1.3460 on\par Friday in the wake of disappointing U.S. payrolls data.\par   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The dollar slid across the board on Friday when data showed the U.S. economy generated only 112,000 new jobs in November, below the 180,000 forecast.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 While the data did not change the outlook for the Federal Reserve to steadily rachet up U.S. interest rates, it gave traders another reason to pound the dollar which has already fallen around 9 percent against the euro and the yen since early October.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Euro zone finance ministers meet in Brussels on Monday evening and are expecting to discuss whether the euro's rise is harming the region's economy.   \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041206e0c6005vu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
