\par\par \b \uc2 ANALYSIS- \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2 /Europe joint  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2  unlikely for now.   \b0\par\par\uc2 By Natsuko Waki   \par \uc2 739 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 2004\par 19:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 LONDON, Dec 2 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's insistence this week that Europe and the United States share its concern over the falling dollar is unlikely to herald joint or even bilateral European-Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  yet, analysts say.   \par \par \uc2 Media speculation and remarks from monetary officials in Tokyo about possible European-Japanese action to curb the dollar's fall met with no comment from European officials.   \par \par \uc2 In addition the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reiterated its anti-inflation stance on Thursday and kept its warning about unwelcome \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves to a well-worn script.   \par \par \uc2 "Europe is unlikely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  given inflation remaining above two percent and a strong euro is not as harmful as in the beginning of the year," said Umberto Alvisi, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at CSFB.   \par \par \uc2 "We believe Japan is also willing to bear more \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation. Most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are moving higher against the dollar... If all the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were to move up against the dollar the appreciation of your \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not mean a loss of competitiveness."   \par \par \uc2 The dollar, under pressure on concerns about the huge U.S. current account deficit, has hit a succession of record lows on the euro and a five-year low on the yen. Market conviction that Washington is currently happy to see it fall is key to the latest leg of the sell-off.   \par \par \uc2 "The Europeans would like to get involved but only in concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that would include the United States - and we're certainly not going to get that," said Derek Halpenny, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi in London.   \par \par \uc2 "The key difference is the way in which the U.S. authorities through the Federal Reserve have given a clear indication of their desire for an orderly move lower in the dollar."   \par \par \uc2 JAPAN AND FLEXIBILITY   \par \par \uc2 Japanese monetary officials are worried a rapidly rising yen could derail a recovery in the export-oriented economy.   \par \par \uc2 Japan, which spent around $330 billion fighting the dollar's slide between January 2003 and March 2004, has repeatedly warned it would act if needed.   \par \par \uc2 So far there have been no signs of yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but unilateral action by the Japanese authorities cannot be ruled out the closer the dollar falls towards 100 yen.   \par \par \uc2 And a bigger-than-expected surplus in the Bank of Japan's money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  for Friday has left the market wondering if this could be a sign Tokyo bought dollars for yen.   \par \par \uc2 It was through such discrepancies that the market first detected the start of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 15-month \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  campaign in 2003.   \par \par \uc2 In addition \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stepped up its rhetoric about undesirable \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves, with monetary officials warning almost on a daily basis they would take decisive action.   \par \par \uc2 However analysts say the whole issue of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  flexibility - which Group of 20 major economic powers agreed to promote last month - means Japan and Europe would, for different reasons, find it difficult to justify joint action for now.   \par \par \uc2 "The Europeans' complaint stems from the fact they feel they take a disproportionate degree of the dollar's correction. They feel Asia needs to move towards more flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies," said Halpenny.   \par \par \uc2 "It would be a clear contradiction for them to turn around and act in a joint manner with the Japanese authorities given this is one of their main complaints."   \par \par \uc2 STILL MILD   \par \par \uc2 Analysts say the rhetoric from the ECB has been far milder than the war of words which preceded the bank's maiden \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2000 when it stepped in with other Group of Seven central banks to prop the euro up.   \par \par \uc2 Prior to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , euro zone policymakers repeatedly warned the move did not reflect fundamentals. They said they wanted a strong euro and official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was an option.   \par \par \uc2 Central banks from Group of 10 and other countries also saw the euro as undervalued.   \par \par \uc2 So far, no euro zone official has said the recent rise in the euro had made it "overvalued". Trichet has been sending warnings about the speed of the move.   \par \par \uc2 "There is no indication as to what the ECB will or won't do," Steve Barrow, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Bear Stearns.   \par \par \uc2 "We would get more verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  first, both warning the markets what's to come and in encouraging the markets as to how things are going right for the dollar. But that has to come from the U.S."   \par \par \uc2 - Additional reporting by Carolyn Cohn and Charlotte Cooper.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041202e0c200a6q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
