\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-ECB's Constancio-No comment on  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2  report.  \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 2004\par 09:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 FRANKFURT, Dec 2 (Reuters) - European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governing Council member Vitor Constancio declined comment on Thursday about a newspaper report that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  and euro zone authorities have discussed joint \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "No comment," Constancio, who heads the Portugal \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said as he arrived at the ECB for its policy-setting Governing Council meeting.  \par \par \uc2 The Financial Times in a report on Thursday headlined "ECB considers joint \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  move," said that Japan and euro zone authorities have discussed the prospect of joint \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the euro and Japanese yen keep rising against the U.S. dollar.  \par \par \uc2 The FT report attributed the comment to a senior Japanese finance ministry official, who spoke to reporters on the condition of anonymity. It said he declined to comment on his European counterpart's response but said that a common euro zone view had emerged that the euro had reached levels that were harming Europe's economy.  \par \par \uc2 The ECB, which has responsibility for \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , declined to comment on the report.  \par \par \uc2 The euro hit a new hit on Thursday of $1.3383, and the Japanese yen rose to a five-year high at 102.68.  \par \par \uc2 Hiroshi Watanabe, Japan's Vice Finance Minister for International Affairs, separately on Wednesday had told reporters that Japan and Europe can act together in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041202e0c2005bx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
