ave regularly warned that the government will take action if it feels that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements are too disruptive or are straying too far from economic fundamentals Tuesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  data covers trades which settle in November. Spot \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trades are settled after two business days.  \par \par \uc2 -By Stanley White, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; stanley.white@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 Copyright 2004 Dow Jones. All rights reserved.  \par \par \uc2 Dokument OSTDJ00020041130e0bu002yd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
