\par\par \b \uc2 Japan Tanigaki: To Take Stern  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Action As Needed  \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 November 2004\par 01:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Japan's finance minister issued a fresh warning Friday over big swings in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates, saying the government stands ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to curb such moves if necessary.  \par \par \uc2 "There is no change in our position that we will take timely and stern action against sharp and unstable moves" in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, Sadakazu Tanigaki told a regular press conference.  \par \par \uc2 Tanigaki added that he was watching \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets closely, though he declined to comment on specific exchange rate levels.  \par \par \uc2 The dollar has fallen steadily against all other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the last few weeks on concerns over the huge U.S. fiscal, trade and current account deficits.  \par \par \uc2 That fall has put market players on the lookout for yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the behest of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  to underpin the U.S. unit.  \par \par \uc2 A stronger yen makes Japanese exports more expensive in dollar terms and reduces the sale value of those exports when translated back into yen.  \par \par \uc2 At 0105 GMT Friday, the dollar was changing hands at Y102.55 after dropping to Y102.35 in the morning, a near five-year low for the pair.  \par \par \uc2 -By James Simms, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; james.simms@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Hugh Lawson and Shawn Schroter [ 26-11-04 0110GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020041126e0bq0000p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
